{
  "_comment": [
    "Public LoRA adapters for Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, verified 2026-10-10 by",
    "reading each repo's adapter_config.json from the Hugging Face API.",
    "",
    "The 'blendable' flag is decided by a single thing: whether the adapter can be",
    "averaged with the others in factor space. LoraHub-style blending sums the A and",
    "B matrices across adapters and multiplies the sums, so every adapter in a blend",
    "must agree on r, lora_alpha and target_modules. Six of the seven agree exactly.",
    "The medical adapter does not and is therefore evaluated only as a single adapter.",
    "",
    "Revisions are pinned so a re-run months from now loads the same bytes these",
    "numbers came from. A 'main' that has moved on would silently change the result."
  ],
